WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.918 --> 00:00:04.295
KUMAIL NANJIANI
In the beginning, there was nothing.

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:08.717
Even the Infinity Stones were
but the shadow of a dream.

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:12.762
Then, there was the first sun, galaxies,
and a bunch of other boring stuff...

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:18.685
And then, there was Kingo! Eternal
extraordinaire and giant movie star.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:22.188
Pure of heart
and big of bicep, he...

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.649
Um... Sorry...
Did you say anything?

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.320
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Thank you.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:34.367
Bestowed with powers far beyond
a mortal man, Kingo protects humanity

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:39.748
from evil Deviants, aided in his quest
by a revolving cast of sidekicks,

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:40.707
some of whom really...

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:41.875
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Wow...

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:42.876
SALMA HAYEK
Seriously, dude?

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:45.545
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Sidekicks... That is rich.

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:46.755
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Oh! I was just making it my own!

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.173
SALMA HAYEK
Like everything! You make everything

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:48.798
your own!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.468
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Sorry! Sorry! Assistants? Is that better?

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:54.304
Okay, I can see
that's not good. Helpers?

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.180
ANGELINA JOLIE
What's going on?

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.347
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Oh, you're gonna love this. Tell her.

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:57.307
SALMA HAYEK
Uh-huh.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:58.558
KUMAIL NANJIANI
I... was...

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.018
SALMA HAYEK
What'd you say? Go on.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:04.814
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Angelina Jolie's not one of the sidekicks.

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:06.524
She's one of the main ones.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:07.067
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Okay.

00:01:07.108 --> 00:01:08.401
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Alright, alright! I'll start over.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:11.112
Lemme, just...
Start over. Okay?

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.113
SALMA HAYEK
Please!

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.076
KUMAIL NANJIANI
In the beginning...

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.623
KUMAIL NANJIANI
If you guys could not look at me,

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:23.917
it makes me very... Just...

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:24.793
SALMA HAYEK
Okay, we'll turn around

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:25.585
but she's got her weapons.

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:26.586
ANGELINA JOLIE
We're all gonna turn around.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:27.712
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Yeah, just turn around...

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:28.755
Thank you.

